    {\fontsize{20}{26}\selectfont\color{textgray}Water security; WBG \$400M commitment}
  }}
}

\posterbox[bluecard, title={Key Research Themes in Recent Issues}
]{name=research, column=2, between=row16 and row23}{%
  \fontsize{25}{33}\selectfont
  \renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.60}
  \setlength{\tabcolsep}{7pt}
  \begin{tabular}{@{}p{0.30\linewidth}p{0.64\linewidth}@{}}
    \rowcolor{secondary!13}
    {\fontsize{21}{27}\selectfont\bfseries\color{secondary} Theme} &
    {\fontsize{21}{27}\selectfont\bfseries\color{secondary} Selected Topics} \\
    \rowcolor{white}
    Fiscal Policy & Rebuilding fiscal space; fiscal rules for small states \\
    \rowcolor{secondary!7}
    Trade \& Supply Chains & High trade costs; GVC \& COVID-19 impacts \\
    \rowcolor{white}
